    "summary": "Each model dimension with a chunk call gets a gather plan (adapters/code-review-gather.ts): obligationCall judges each key once with today's findings schema and rules, on all chunks' notes and its own context; a key with no notes is judged on the no-evidence statement; reduceCall condenses notes within noteCapChars; notesFrom reads chunk notes; partOf maps an answer to a part. After the first gate: a promised test is judged under its own framing (no symbol grading) and the gather's validate rejects any non-promised-test finding, so with zero atoms nothing is reported as symbol coverage (tested on a diff review divided with zero atoms); conventions findings name the breached documented-rule id, not the module text.",
